ass=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"ex\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"ex\">EX</span><span data-text=\"aere\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"aes\">AERE</span><span data-text=\"conlato\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"confero\">CONLATO</span><span data-text=\"patrono\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"patronus\">PATRONO</span><span data-text=\"bene\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"bene\">BENE</span><span data-text=\"de\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"de\">DE</span><span data-text=\"se\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"se\">SE</span><span data-text=\"merito\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"mereo\">MERITO</span><span data-text=\"curante\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"curo\">CURANTE</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"et\">ET</span><span data-text=\"de\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"de\">DE</span><span data-text=\"suo\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"suus\">SUO</span><span data-text=\"quod\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"quod\">QUOD</span><span data-text=\"defuerat\" data-n=\"75\" data-lemma=\"defuo\">DEFUERAT</span><span data-text=\"supplente\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"suppleo\">SUPPLENTE</span><span data-text=\"Paconio\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"Paconius\">PACONIO</span><span data-text=\"Clodiano\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Clodianus\">CLODIANO</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text from Gualtherus; Mommsen adds interpuncts throughout, but these are not recorded by Gualtherus and so have no basis in fact.</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Mommsen notes the smiilarity to CIL 10.7294 = <a href=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000551\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000551</a> and so speculates that this might be a doublet in the antiquarian tradition.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Gualtherus 1624 249 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] 146 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Castelli 1769 cl. 5, no. 28 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002084\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002084</a>  </li><li> Castelli 1784 cl. 5, no. 29 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7238</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
